At approximately **0.9 s** in the clips Benny passes the opening station. At **1.0–2.5 s** he steers left and right. Look at **3.67–4.00 s** for the greatest visual differences in the deeper tunnel. The transition is at **4.92 s**.

The reconstructed gold drum curves and there is less foam in front of Benny on hard turns. The distant river looks suspended. At the opening cyan water fills the original purple gap. Claudia’s opening scores 79.09% on the defined color-tolerance measurement, and the rejected reconstruction scores 38.09%. These numbers count native pixels with mean absolute RGB differences at most 20 out of 255. They apply only to the original camera view.

The saved gameplay tests passed 8/8. The full successful ride collected 91 coins, retained five hearts and took the score from 1,330 to 2,240. The capture came from desktop Chromium with software WebGL. Physical Android performance still needs testing.

**checks/** includes the matched camera and motion verification, opening measurements, a full timestamped frame scan, original GitHub checkpoints, the independently reopened Blender model check and the depth/steering diagnostic. **REVIEW_SHA256.json** lists the SHA-256 of every other file in this ZIP. The files can be reviewed without credentials after download.
